OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on 'anchor' cancer
OL,4,Asupport centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalking about after Andrew's death,
OL,7,FSore said: "I was numb some days, but I
OL,8,Fwas just able to chat to them and they
OL,9,Fwere listening to me... and I could
OL,10,Fjust be myself and I felt safe when I
OL,11,Fwent there."
